                    "rules": "This ability always takes the form <b>[RAPID FIRE X]</b>. Each time you gather <b>attack dice</b> for a <b>[RAPID FIRE]</b> weapon, add <b>X</b> additional <b>attack dice</b> if the target unit was within half range of that weapon in the Select Targets step.\n\n<b>Example:</b> If a <b>[RAPID FIRE 1]</b> weapon with an <b>A</b> characteristic of 1 targets a unit that is within half range, you would gather one additional <b>attack dice</b> for that weapon (for a total of two for that weapon)."
